{"ref":"BDB, יוֹאָח","hw":"יוֹאָח","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">יוֹאָח</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. (</strong><span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> <em>is brother;</em> cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, אֲחִיָּ֫הוּ\" href=\"/BDB,_אֲחִיָּ֫הוּ\", dir=\"rtl\">אֲחִיָּהוּ</a> & reff.<strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>1.</strong>  son of Asaph the chronicler in Hezekiah’s time <a data-ref=\"II Kings 18:18\" href=\"/II_Kings.18.18\">2 K 18:18</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 18:26\" href=\"/II_Kings.18.26\">26</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 18:37\" href=\"/II_Kings.18.37\">37</a> (𝔊 Ἰωας, 𝔊L Ἰωαχ), = <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 36:3\" href=\"/Isaiah.36.3\">Is 36:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 36:11\" href=\"/Isaiah.36.11\">11</a>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 36:22\" href=\"/Isaiah.36.22\">22</a> (𝔊 Ἰωαχ).<br><strong>2.</strong>  Levites <strong>a.</strong>  son of Zimmah <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 6:6\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.6.6\">1 Ch 6:6</a>; <strong>b.</strong>  <em>id.</em> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 29:12\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.29.12\">2 Ch 29:12</a><sup>(×2)</sup> (𝔊 Ἰωα, Ἰωαχ(α) Ἰωδααθ).<br><strong>3.</strong>  son of Joahaz the chronicler in Josiah’s time <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 34:8\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.34.8\">2 Ch 34:8</a> (𝔊 Ἰωαχ, Ἰωας).<br><strong>4.</strong>  a Levite, son of Obed-edom <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 26:4\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.26.4\">1 Ch 26:4</a> (𝔊 Ἰωαθ, Ἰωαα, Ἰωαδ).","next":"BDB, יוֹאָחָז","prev":"BDB, יוֹאָב"}